<<<
You do not e. care, i.e. that you are careful, but your state of instruction may e. care, i.e. that either you or your instructors have been careful, & you may by being obviously well instructed e. your instructors’ care.
===
*You* do not e. care, i. e. that you are careful, but your state of instruction may e. care, i. e. that either you or your instructors have been careful, & *you* may by being obviously well instructed e. *your instructors’* care.
>>>

<<<
It will be seen that show or exhibit could take the place of e. in the places that have been said to allow of it, but also that they would stand where it has been said that e. could not.
===
It will be seen that *show* or *exhibit* could take the place of *e.* in the places that have been said to allow of it, but also that they would stand where it has been said that *e.* could not.
>>>

