<<<
An example of each surviving sense may be useful:— The contrivances of nature decidedly e. intention—Paley (i.e. are an evidence of); The knees & upper part of the leg evincing muscular strength—Scott (i.e., giving tokens of possessing, or revealing the presence of). f
===
An example of each surviving sense may be useful:—*The contrivances of nature decidedly e. intention*—Paley (i. e., are an evidence of); *The knees & upper part of the leg evincing muscular strength*—Scott (i. e., giving tokens of possessing, or revealing the presence of).
>>>

